    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Originally known as Trough Shoals, the area was purchased in 1881 to develop a textile mill along the river.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.townofpacolet.com/our-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Pacolet Manufacturing Company became operational in 1884 and was once one of the leading textile companies in the early 1900s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21,
        22,
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.townofpacolet.com/our-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Mill owners built an entire town around their operation, including all the housing and infrastructure needed to attract employees.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.townofpacolet.com/our-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Central Pacolet is proud to be one of the twenty Preserve America Communities in South Carolina.",
